'''Deluxe Pack: ex''' (Japanese: '''{{j|ハイクラスパックex}}''' ''High Class Pack ex'') is the first deluxe pack, and eleventh expansion overall, in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Deluxe Pack: ex''' is the first deluxe pack released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. Similar to High Class Packs in the {{Trading Card Game}}, it primarily features cards from previous expansions, including every {{Rar/TCGP|Diamond|4}} {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} released in booster packs from {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} through {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}}. Deluxe Pack: ex also introduced parallel foil cards to TCG Pocket.

Unlike previous expansions, booster packs of Deluxe Pack: ex only contain four cards instead of five. However, each pack is guaranteed to include at least one card of {{Rar/TCGP|Diamond|4}} rarity or higher. In [[Wonder Pick]], two Pack Hourglasses are the fifth option instead of a card.

Deluxe Pack: ex was first available between Sept. 29, 2025, at 11 p.m. PDT and Oct. 29, 2025, at 10:59 p.m. PDT, and later returned between Jan. 14, 2026, at 11 p.m. PDT and Jan. 29, 2026, at 10:59 p.m. PDT. Booster packs from the expansion will be made available again in the future.

